WEBVTT

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:30.120
I can't stand that noise.

00:00:51.630 --> 00:00:53.400
That flying power...

00:00:59.910 --> 00:01:02.950
It must be him.

00:01:02.950 --> 00:01:04.100
Who?

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:11.170
Mikage! What are you doing here?

00:01:11.510 --> 00:01:14.170
Don't change the subject, Izumo.

00:01:14.850 --> 00:01:16.120
Who are you talking about?

00:01:18.410 --> 00:01:21.560
Fine, I'll say it for you.

00:01:22.230 --> 00:01:28.190
He's the pilot of the Machine Angel who unsealed the forbidden Union.

00:01:28.190 --> 00:01:32.980
With golden eyes and amber hair that flutters in the breeze.

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:41.360
A young boy who resembles our sleeping Eve.

00:03:21.490 --> 00:03:24.440
Altair has lost all of its women.

00:03:24.440 --> 00:03:27.840
We, its denizens, are heading towards extinction.

00:03:28.370 --> 00:03:33.100
We began investigating Vega, hoping to find the solution.

00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:36.540
And so,

00:03:37.410 --> 00:03:43.300
we formed a plan to capture Rare Iguras,
women who could withstand Altair's environment,

00:03:43.300 --> 00:03:47.780
and use them as Eves to bear the future of our world.

00:03:49.170 --> 00:03:55.800
One of the candidates was that sleeping Eve: Alicia.

00:03:57.990 --> 00:04:03.760
But when subjected to dimensional
travel, she fell into a deathlike sleep,

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:05.540
and hasn't awakened since.

00:04:06.710 --> 00:04:10.020
Now she's just used trash.

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:14.860
While we returned to Altair, she bore a child,

00:04:14.860 --> 00:04:18.960
and left it on Vega when we came back for her.

00:04:21.430 --> 00:04:23.900
But that's not important.

00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:28.030
She couldn't be our True Eve.

00:04:28.610 --> 00:04:31.040
She'll just sleep in there forever.

00:04:31.650 --> 00:04:34.920
Nothing but a doll for you to gaze at for comfort.

00:04:35.470 --> 00:04:36.920
A wingless butterfly.

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:38.920
For comfort?

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:41.980
How sad, Izumo.

00:04:42.470 --> 00:04:45.280
The scales of a wingless butterfly

00:04:45.280 --> 00:04:48.020
are nothing but a mirage.

00:04:48.870 --> 00:04:50.360
So we might as well...

00:04:51.430 --> 00:04:53.940
put an end to this long dream.

00:04:57.900 --> 00:04:59.480
Mikage!

00:05:06.410 --> 00:05:09.240
You will not lay a hand on Alicia!

00:05:10.630 --> 00:05:12.660
Then tell me, Izumo.

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:15.760
How would you make this dream end?

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:19.560
Jin has infiltrated the Machine Angel's nest!

00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:23.170
We can choose from the Rare Iguras who pilot it!

00:05:27.790 --> 00:05:30.460
Did you know, Izumo?

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:37.690
On Vega, butterflies are a symbol of rebirth.

00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:43.300
Thus, forbidden love shall be reborn.

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:55.750
Oh, Kagura.

00:05:59.150 --> 00:06:02.680
You're such a beast.

00:06:10.290 --> 00:06:13.470
Wonderful, Kagura. More.

00:06:14.650 --> 00:06:17.000
I can feel it roaring within you.

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:20.000
Soon, your past will be unleashed.

00:06:20.530 --> 00:06:23.910
Every bit of it, leaving not a drop behind.

00:06:23.910 --> 00:06:30.500
Yes, those memories of Apollon and Silvie sleeping inside you.

00:06:35.810 --> 00:06:40.500
Silvie is so close to your heart.

00:06:41.970 --> 00:06:44.750
She sighs delicately, and her voice is so sweet...

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:50.340
She could bring bliss to the heavens themselves.

00:06:51.670 --> 00:06:58.390
Following her warmth, a love has been reborn countless times.

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:03.400
You want that love, don't you?

00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:08.530
You yearn for the forbidden Union, don't you?

00:07:08.530 --> 00:07:09.740
Kagura!

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:12.620
More.

00:07:13.170 --> 00:07:15.300
Want it more.

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:17.950
Even more!

00:07:23.450 --> 00:07:25.130
Perfect.

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:29.320
You are a hungry beast, howling for love!

00:07:39.450 --> 00:07:42.660
Go, beast of love.

00:07:42.660 --> 00:07:47.800
Go find your love, and sate your hunger.

00:08:31.510 --> 00:08:32.540
An animal?

00:08:38.090 --> 00:08:39.490
Izumo...

00:08:40.170 --> 00:08:47.120
I don't care about the revival of the Rare Igura that will bear Altair's future.

00:08:49.110 --> 00:08:55.840
I want the rebirth of the Machine
Angel of Genesis slumbering in Vega.

00:09:07.270 --> 00:09:09.980
Who are you?

00:09:11.210 --> 00:09:12.360
Just remember this.

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:17.100
I will never trust you.

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:20.700
And if you ever try something ever again,

00:09:22.030 --> 00:09:23.370
I'll get you.

00:09:31.830 --> 00:09:34.780
What was that power?

00:09:40.730 --> 00:09:43.430
Will Akbarjin Batbayar please come out?

00:09:45.250 --> 00:09:49.690
Now, no more trying to sneak into the girls' dorms.

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:54.040
Cayenne, you pointed a gun at your classmates.

00:09:54.040 --> 00:09:56.620
Stay in there a bit longer and think about what you've done.

00:09:59.690 --> 00:10:00.800
What is that?

00:10:00.800 --> 00:10:05.410
I... I thought you liked Alicia, so...

00:10:06.530 --> 00:10:07.920
That's supposed to be Alicia?

00:10:08.730 --> 00:10:11.420
It's not perfect, but...

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:13.880
At least the face looks similar, right?

00:10:15.750 --> 00:10:17.660
I'm sorry!

00:10:23.650 --> 00:10:25.430
Where are his manners?

00:10:29.690 --> 00:10:31.540
Akbarjin Batbayar...

00:10:32.270 --> 00:10:34.400
is an impostor!

00:10:36.290 --> 00:10:38.520
I see no problem with that.

00:10:40.770 --> 00:10:44.900
He passed Neo-Deava's final tests.

00:10:44.900 --> 00:10:45.410
But...

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:48.020
What we need is—

00:10:48.020 --> 00:10:50.170
The power to isolate.

00:10:55.090 --> 00:10:59.080
Didn't Yunoha say she understands how Jin feels?

00:10:59.080 --> 00:11:02.120
Yeah. There's a lot we don't know about him,

00:11:02.120 --> 00:11:04.620
but at least he doesn't seem like a bad guy.

00:11:04.620 --> 00:11:09.600
If we got to know him better, we could ask him, and get to understand him better.

00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:13.110
Yeah, I guess we could...

00:11:18.530 --> 00:11:21.860
<i>Mikono, I have to...</i>

00:11:22.970 --> 00:11:25.030
<i>I want to know...</i>

00:11:25.030 --> 00:11:26.860
<i>I have to ask...</i>

00:11:27.290 --> 00:11:28.520
<i>About him...</i>

00:11:28.520 --> 00:11:30.290
<i>About that man...</i>

00:11:30.810 --> 00:11:33.790
<i>His eyes looked so lonely.</i>

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:36.550
<i>Forgive him? For what?</i>

00:11:36.890 --> 00:11:39.240
<i>Like a stray dog.</i>

00:11:40.110 --> 00:11:42.550
Sorry we're late!

00:11:43.510 --> 00:11:45.680
The line was so long!

00:11:46.670 --> 00:11:49.730
Hey, what's with you two sitting together and moping?

00:11:51.790 --> 00:11:52.480
Nothing...

00:11:54.870 --> 00:11:56.460
I forgot my juice!

00:12:01.400 --> 00:12:02.780
Hey, can I have a sip?

00:12:07.280 --> 00:12:08.580
Public indecency!

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:10.200
Hey, that's an indirect kiss!

00:12:12.450 --> 00:12:13.620
An indirect kiss?

00:12:15.150 --> 00:12:16.670
Can I try some of yours, too?

00:12:19.690 --> 00:12:20.920
Fine.

00:12:22.250 --> 00:12:26.050
Man, Zessica, you're really thirsty, huh?

00:12:32.670 --> 00:12:34.090
Are you all right?

00:12:34.090 --> 00:12:35.120
Yeah, but...

00:12:35.120 --> 00:12:36.700
Something's in the hangar!

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:45.610
Kagura?

00:12:46.930 --> 00:12:48.200
Close the gate!

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:48.960
Yes, sir!

00:12:48.960 --> 00:12:52.700
Don't let Kagura get to Vega!

00:12:54.990 --> 00:12:56.980
Kagura...

00:12:57.710 --> 00:13:00.550
Let me give you a flower for your journey.

00:13:01.030 --> 00:13:06.300
I pray that the fire of love in your eyes

00:13:06.630 --> 00:13:09.560
sheds light on the Machine Angel of Genesis.

00:13:16.210 --> 00:13:18.020
So the time has come.

00:13:25.430 --> 00:13:28.760
I don't care how thirsty you are!

00:13:28.760 --> 00:13:31.800
Don't do things like that in public!

00:13:31.800 --> 00:13:35.220
Why don't you brew a pot of barley tea in advance?

00:13:35.220 --> 00:13:37.040
I don't like barley tea.

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:40.420
Fine, then black. Or oolong.

00:13:40.420 --> 00:13:42.840
Either way, just don't do that again.

00:13:43.760 --> 00:13:45.380
Hey, where are you going?

00:13:46.710 --> 00:13:48.300
Back to the dorms.

00:13:49.710 --> 00:13:51.820
Don't you have afternoon classes?

00:13:52.450 --> 00:13:54.270
Hey, Zessica!

00:13:54.270 --> 00:13:57.440
I tried to stitch the inside of the hem evenly,

00:13:57.440 --> 00:13:59.150
but it didn't work very well...

00:14:01.570 --> 00:14:05.650
So bittersweet...

00:14:06.010 --> 00:14:07.280
I think it's great.

00:14:07.850 --> 00:14:10.320
I hope Jin opens up to her.

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:13.680
You think this isn't going to affect you?

00:14:13.680 --> 00:14:17.720
Listen, the ladies are always thirsty for love.

00:14:17.720 --> 00:14:20.440
Remember Zessica at lunch?

00:14:20.440 --> 00:14:22.670
What does that mean?

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:24.580
If you want it, you gotta dig.

00:14:24.580 --> 00:14:27.510
Dig down to the well in Mikono's heart.

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:28.510
You see?

00:14:29.690 --> 00:14:31.340
Mikono's...

00:14:36.610 --> 00:14:38.350
But I can't do that.

00:14:38.830 --> 00:14:40.440
You know love is forbidden.

00:14:40.440 --> 00:14:45.420
That shouldn't be an issue when this war with the Abductors is over.

00:14:45.420 --> 00:14:47.300
But you'd better reserve her for then.

00:14:47.300 --> 00:14:48.530
Reserve?

00:14:48.530 --> 00:14:51.100
Mikono's a cutie.

00:14:51.100 --> 00:14:54.950
If you stall, someone else is going to take her away from you.

00:15:05.470 --> 00:15:08.720
Mikono, can I talk to you?

00:15:10.670 --> 00:15:12.430
You're gonna do it right now?!

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:16.820
Well, he is the second hole digging bro.

00:15:16.820 --> 00:15:19.310
He's standing up for himself.

00:15:24.610 --> 00:15:25.610
What?

00:15:28.230 --> 00:15:29.200
Kagura!

00:15:29.860 --> 00:15:32.240
You've lost your senses.

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:34.450
I can't let you go to Vega.

00:15:34.890 --> 00:15:37.480
Who dares stop me?!

00:15:48.250 --> 00:15:52.260
Kagura! Get out of the Mithra and go back to Izumo!

00:15:52.260 --> 00:15:53.740
Damn you!

00:15:56.850 --> 00:15:59.860
Stay out of our way!

00:16:04.150 --> 00:16:06.100
Yo, Izumo, you old fart.

00:16:06.100 --> 00:16:10.360
You want Ianthe to get smashed, or you want to open the gate for me?

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:12.600
Make your choice!

00:16:22.400 --> 00:16:23.540
How can this be?

00:16:23.970 --> 00:16:28.350
Kagura's combat abilities have increased tenfold!

00:16:30.610 --> 00:16:33.800
Blooms out of season, but falls in a blink.

00:16:34.450 --> 00:16:37.580
Such is the Kagura camellia.

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:41.060
Do you understand, Izumo?

00:16:41.630 --> 00:16:45.610
Everything I do, I do for love!

00:17:00.850 --> 00:17:01.840
What?

00:17:04.610 --> 00:17:07.340
All units are out of the line of fire!

00:17:07.340 --> 00:17:08.290
We're clear!

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:10.210
Open fire!

00:17:22.190 --> 00:17:23.480
Give me...

00:17:24.090 --> 00:17:26.520
my wench!

00:17:34.360 --> 00:17:36.360
Kagura...

00:17:36.770 --> 00:17:38.740
Let me awaken your love!

00:18:03.870 --> 00:18:05.840
What does she have that I don't?

00:18:06.690 --> 00:18:09.100
That Mikono...

00:18:17.970 --> 00:18:19.040
Apollon...

00:18:20.350 --> 00:18:21.530
Silvie...

00:18:24.410 --> 00:18:26.400
Silvie...

00:18:38.110 --> 00:18:40.140
What's the matter, Mikono?

00:18:41.030 --> 00:18:41.850
Nothing.

00:18:42.330 --> 00:18:43.930
So what did you want to talk about?

00:18:46.030 --> 00:18:47.240
Um...

00:18:48.730 --> 00:18:51.480
It's about that guy...

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:52.690
Someone else is going to take her from you.

00:18:54.050 --> 00:18:55.940
No, wait! It's not like that!

00:18:57.380 --> 00:18:58.030
It's not?

00:18:59.130 --> 00:19:00.720
Wait. That's not what I meant!

00:19:00.720 --> 00:19:04.660
Um... so...

00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:07.830
Oh no!

00:19:07.830 --> 00:19:09.280
Amata?

00:19:09.280 --> 00:19:14.790
C-Can you look that way for a second?

00:19:14.790 --> 00:19:15.780
Please!

00:19:21.230 --> 00:19:27.810
Um... I... not right now, but...

00:19:27.810 --> 00:19:28.580
Yes?

00:19:30.370 --> 00:19:33.110
After the war with the Abductors is over,

00:19:33.690 --> 00:19:36.060
would you...

00:19:50.610 --> 00:19:53.360
Scream for me, Kagura.

00:19:54.250 --> 00:19:58.620
Your love may not be with you now,

00:19:59.170 --> 00:20:04.120
but you can change everything with a mere scream.

00:20:06.210 --> 00:20:09.180
You can reverse everything.

00:20:23.270 --> 00:20:24.480
It's cold.

00:20:26.070 --> 00:20:29.580
Their blows... feel cold.

00:20:46.110 --> 00:20:47.620
Hold still, Kagura!

00:20:51.630 --> 00:20:52.810
It stinks.

00:20:54.430 --> 00:20:58.320
I want to kill that wench.

00:21:00.150 --> 00:21:01.480
I want to kill her,

00:21:02.510 --> 00:21:04.700
then take her in my arms...

00:21:07.200 --> 00:21:09.120
and crush her!

00:21:11.750 --> 00:21:13.140
My...

00:21:16.130 --> 00:21:18.420
Silvie!

00:21:28.250 --> 00:21:30.260
Magnificent!

00:21:33.830 --> 00:21:36.240
Will you...

00:21:42.590 --> 00:21:43.530
Mikono?

00:21:58.210 --> 00:22:00.260
What is that power?

00:22:01.250 --> 00:22:04.130
Mikage! Is this your doing?

00:22:04.870 --> 00:22:07.350
You wound me.

00:22:07.350 --> 00:22:12.060
Kagura is merely answering the call of the wild.

00:22:26.190 --> 00:22:29.580
Now go, Kagura.

00:22:31.110 --> 00:22:34.020
To the holy land of love!

00:24:11.170 --> 00:24:15.300
That day at the movies was when we first met.

00:24:15.810 --> 00:24:19.180
I've constantly been in flight ever since then.

00:24:19.640 --> 00:24:21.850
I'm so embarrassed!

00:24:22.230 --> 00:24:24.560
Next time on Aquarion Evol: <i>Skies of Aquaria.</i>
